    "note": "**v1 PROD GATE — `@m0saic/alpine/progress-card/v1`** (gate 9; chart: `.ai/LAUNCH/v1-template-cut.md`). Props = showcase defaults (Quarterly Goals). Single version — no dep riders.\n\n| Stage | Current | Proposed |\n|---|---|---|\n| Flags | not internal, not deprecated, primitive:true | confirm |\n| Gate | — | **base** |\n| Preview assets | re-mint after approval | review |\n| Cover / Tutorial | cover BUILT this gate (grow-in starts near-blank) | eyeball cover; tutorial needed? |\n\n**Pre-audit found + fixed 2 bug classes:**\n1. **Uneven bar thickness at DEFAULTS** (track equal-size tripwire): the interleaved [margin,row,gap,row,…] stack spread track heights 16% at 900×900 (21px vs 25px bars side by side) — rebuilt as EQUAL row bands with the half-gap carved inside ([1,K,1]), the established pack pattern. Rows shift by a half-gap; thickness now uniform ±1px everywhere.\n2. **Uncapped label/value fonts** (text-fit class): 24-char labels needed ~402px in a 299px slot at 480×1040; long custom Displays (\"$45,200 of $60,000\") overflowed their 30% column 2.3×. Both now width-capped at the pack 0.62em model (×0.88 realized-cell factor); floor-bound text ellipsizes.\n\nAlso NEW this gate: debugLayout contract (track equal-size + text-fit; text checks gated on expr-free docs per the zip candidate), content-too-small guard, renderCover (static default card + welcome band).\n\n**Primitive-sense (your new lens): KEEP primitive:true.** Goal-fraction rows with tracks are a distinct composable block — closest sibling is horizontal bar-graph, but the semantics differ (progress-to-target with track + per-row value display vs. compared magnitudes on an axis). No overlap worth collapsing.\n\nBattery: 84/84 CLI renders feasible (14 canvases × 6 configs, re-run post-fix), probe 14/14 green, 16/16 unit.",
